descriptions.job-0x3vegv:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager II on the Growth team within the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Consumer &amp;amp; Business&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; group, you&#39;ll own the end-to-end notifications platform spanning push, in-app, and email channels. This team drives user engagement and retention by delivering the right message to the right user at the right time. You&#39;ll define the strategy for how Coinbase communicates with millions of customers, leveraging ML-powered relevance to increase activation, re-engagement, and lifetime value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product roadmap for Coinbase&#39;s notifications platform across push, in-app, and email channels, balancing infrastructure investment with growth experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable improvements in user engagement, activation, and retention through personalized, ML-powered notification strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Engineering, Data Science, and Marketing to build relevance models that improve targeting precision and reduce notification fatigue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead experimentation programs (A/B and multivariate testing) to validate notification timing, content, and channel selection at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the long-term platform architecture to support new channels, audience segmentation, and real-time personalization capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience with at least 2 years focused on growth, engagement, or lifecycle products at scale (1M+ users).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record shipping ML-powered personalization or relevance features, with demonstrated ability to partner with data science teams on model development and evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in experimentation methodology, including designing A/B tests, defining success metrics, and interpreting results to inform roadmap decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning a multi-channel messaging or notifications platform (push, in-app, email), including deliverability, opt-in optimization, and frequency management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in SQL and data analysis tools, with a demonstrated habit of self-serving insights to drive product decisions without waiting for analyst support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Base salary varies by location (see range below). Total compensation may also include equity and bonus eligibility, and benefits (medical, dental, vision, 401(k)).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$180,370&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$212,200 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Application Limit: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Candidates may submit a maximum of 3 applications within a 6-month period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer: &lt;/strong&gt;Coinbase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. Applicants with criminal histories will be considered consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Applicants: &lt;/strong&gt;View&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppac.pdf&quot;&gt; Employee Rights&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt; Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://static-assets.coinbase.com/e-verify.pdf&quot;&gt; E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; Notice of Participation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;If you are an individual with a disability who needs a reasonable accommodation, email us your request and contact info at accommodations[at]coinbase.com.&amp;nbsp;Need screen reading technology?&lt;a href=&quot;https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/screen-reader/kgejglhpjiefppelpmljglcjbhoiplfn&quot;&gt; Click here&lt;/a&gt; to download a free compatible screen reader and view the&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.chromevox.com/tutorial/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;tutorial&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy &amp;amp; Arbitration: &lt;/strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/applicant_privacy_notice&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. US applicants: By submitting your application, you agree to&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/application-arbitration-agreement&quot;&gt; Arbitration of Disputes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-121c4vz:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world&#39;s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Billing Collections team builds the systems that turn invoices into successful, dependable revenue outcomes. The team develops the foundational capabilities that help businesses collect payments across diverse customer relationships, payment methods, and markets, while adapting intelligently when collection does not go as planned.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the engineering manager for Billing Collections, you’ll own the operational and technical direction of the platforms that help Stripe users collect revenue reliably. You’ll lead the team that builds flexible, intelligent collection experiences that improve payment success, support customers through changing circumstances, and help businesses reduce unpaid balances and accelerate cash flow. You’ll shape the team as it expands to support increasingly sophisticated business models and global payment needs while working backwards from internal and external customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team responsible for the core architecture needed to enable billing collection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical strategy and roadmap for billing collection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive operational excellence across billing infrastructure systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and develop engineers as the team expands into new scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders across organizations to deliver billing solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work backwards from internal and external customer needs to define priorities and scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and uphold engineering standards across a team owning business-critical billing infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of engineering management experience, directly managing and growing teams of 5+ engineers focused on building and shipping products at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of full-time software development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of leading engineering teams responsible for high-traffic, low-latency, and extensible systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep user empathy with a history of working backwards from internal and external customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to drive rigorous decision-making and build strong partnerships across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle ambiguity, creatively solve complex challenges, and execute on competing high-impact priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated focus on system reliability, operational health, and incident response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and leading distributed teams across multiple locations and time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of delivering shared infrastructure across multiple business units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in billing, metering, or large-scale distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with payment mandates, recurring payment authorization, or related payment infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-1e3ezzz:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded by CPAs, tax attorneys, and engineers, Taxbit is the leading innovator automating global tax reporting for the digital economy. Taxbit&#39;s AI-enabled platform streamlines compliance related to digital assets, payments, and other financial transactions. Its unique combination of deep subject matter expertise and AI-forward technology have made it a fast-growing disruptor trusted by the world&#39;s leading fintechs, marketplaces, digital asset players, Big 4 accounting firms, traditional enterprises, and government agencies. Backed by top-tier Silicon Valley VCs, Taxbit&#39;s team is located across offices in San Francisco, New York, Seattle, Salt Lake City, London, Madrid, and Singapore.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunity for Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taxbit is seeking an Enterprise Account Executive, reporting to the Head of Sales, to drive new logo acquisition across leading crypto, fintech and marketplace firms globally. This role is central to Taxbit’s growth as tax information reporting requirements rapidly expand across new jurisdictions, regulatory regimes, and product categories. The ideal candidate brings a strong blend of enterprise sales execution, strategic account development, and intellectual curiosity to understand complex, global, multi-product organizations. Success in this role requires the ability to navigate large enterprises, build relationships across product, tax, finance, and engineering stakeholders, and position Taxbit as the trusted compliance infrastructure for modern digital businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive new logo revenue by identifying, engaging, and closing new enterprise customers across crypto, fintech and marketplaces globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a disciplined pipeline through a combination of strategic outbound prospecting, partner collaboration, and marketing-driven opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct deep prospect research to understand company business models, regulatory exposure, and operational workflows that create tax information reporting obligations, and convert those insights into new customer opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex enterprise sales cycles from initial discovery through contract execution, including multi-threaded stakeholder engagement across tax, finance, product, compliance, and engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategic account plans for target prospects, identifying key decision-makers, economic buyers, and internal champions to accelerate deal velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver compelling executive-level presentations that position Taxbit as the trusted compliance infrastructure for modern digital businesses navigating global tax information reporting requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Marketing, Partnerships, Product, and Technical SMEs to align messaging, validate solution fit, and successfully progress opportunities through the sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure smooth customer transitions to Customer Success following deal close, setting the foundation for long-term adoption, partnership, and future expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop deep expertise in Taxbit’s platform and global tax information reporting frameworks (including 1099 reporting, DAC8, CARF, and other emerging regulations) to effectively advise prospects and differentiate Taxbit in the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a Top Performer Account Executive or in a similar role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8+ years as a full-cycle Enterprise Account Executive (will consider mid-market AE Top Performers)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success closing $100K+ ACV enterprise deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent internal promotions or demonstrated career progression&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No short stints at companies (very few or none under 2-3 years)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in fintech, crypto, payments, marketplaces, or regulated SaaS, or equivalent experience selling into highly regulated financial environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical skills with the ability to translate regulatory complexity into revenue strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding customer communication and executive presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead and influence deeply cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in a fast-paced, highly regulated, and rapidly evolving market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is $94,000-$160,000. Certain roles may be eligible for incentive compensation, equity, and benefits. Actual compensation will vary depending on various job-related factors, including, but not limited to location, experience, level, and job qualifications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive cash compensation (based on experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity (RSUs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A modern 401(k) plan that includes access to crypto, financial wellness benefits, low fees and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model: 3 days in-office, 2 days WFH/flexible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monday team lunches, snacks and drinks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary Time Off - enjoy the flexibility to rest, refuel, and recharge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave to bond with your child&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fertility Benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomous work and flexibility in how work is performed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Taxbit in the News&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/bybit-collaborates-with-taxbit-to-ensure-seamless-financial-compliance-for-global-and-eu-users-302610053.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Bybit Collaborates with Taxbit to Ensure Seamless Financial Compliance for Global and EU Users&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/taxbit-expands-global-platform-to-power-carfdac8-compliance-at-scale-302411671.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Taxbit Expands Global Platform to Power CARF/DAC8 Compliance at Scale&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/taxbit-unveils-industry-first-global-reporting-platform-bridging-digital-and-traditional-finance-302304125.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Taxbit Unveils Industry-First Global Reporting Platform, Bridging Digital and Traditional Finance&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/taxbit-named-to-2024-deloitte-technology-fast-500-list-of-fastest-growing-companies-in-north-america-302313123.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Taxbit Wins the Digital Banker’s 2025 Digital Assets Award for Best Technology Solution Provider for Digital Assets - Tax &amp;amp; Compliance Automation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/taxbit-named-to-2024-deloitte-technology-fast-500-list-of-fastest-growing-companies-in-north-america-302313123.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Taxbit Named to 2024 Deloitte Technology Fast 500™ List of Fastest-Growing Companies in North America&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ffnews.com/newsarticle/paytech/taxbit-appoints-former-oecd-advisor-colby-mangels-as-global-head-of-government-solutions/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Taxbit Appoints Former OECD Advisor Colby Mangels as Global Head of Government Solutions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.taxbit.com/webinars/unlocking-compliance-at-scale-carf-dac8-reporting-for-digital-asset-platforms/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Unlocking Compliance at Scale: CARF/DAC8 Reporting for Digital Asset Platforms&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclaimers&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;By submitting an application for this role, you certify that the information contained in the application is correct to the best of your knowledge. You understand that to falsify information is&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;grounds for refusing to hire you, or for discharge should you be hired.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For US roles, employment with the Company is at will unless otherwise stated in a written agreement signed by the CEO of the Company.&amp;nbsp; This means that either the Company or the employee can terminate the employment at any time and for any reason, with or without notice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0fng9kv:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;section-header section-header--large font-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;About Digital Asset &amp;amp; the Canton Network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital Asset builds the technologies that are reshaping the foundations of financial markets. Our mission is to create the world’s most trusted, privacy-enabled, and interoperable digital infrastructure for global finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of this mission is the Canton Network - the blockchain purpose-built for institutional finance. Uniquely combining privacy, compliance, and scalability, Canton enables real-time, secure settlement across multiple asset classes. Governed by the Canton Foundation with participation from leading financial institutions, it is the proven link between the promise of blockchain and the power of global finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2014 and headquartered in New York City, with offices in London, Zurich, Budapest, Hong Kong, and Sydney— we are on a mission to transform finance— and that transformation is now playing out rapidly on the Canton Network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you’re interested in playing a crucial role at the intersection of traditional and crypto-capital markets and want to help bring the next trillion dollars of finance on-chain, join us.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Lead CX Solution Manager is a player-coach, guiding a focused group of consultants while directly contributing to the success of our clients&#39; Canton Network implementations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads the day-to-day execution of a focused team of CX consultants and solution designers, and manages performance formally and informally to ensure growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acts as the bridge between tactical priorities and front-line client execution, ensuring that core advisory and software delivery processes are followed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Breaks down client project priorities into clear individual goals and actionable delivery plans; manages the team&#39;s capacity and workload effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balances direct individual contribution (client advisory and product design) with people management responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creates and reviews high-quality business analysis and functional requirements using UML diagrams, user stories, and Gherkin scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivers CX professional services to clients and leads workshops, focus groups, and research initiatives to deeply understand customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educates clients and the team about the Canton Network, teaching the in-depth details of privacy-enabled blockchains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages day-to-day client relationships for the duration of project engagements, handling client-facing support, and resolving issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owns project management and Agile governance activities (sprint planning, stand-ups, retrospectives) for active engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides grounded upward feedback to leadership based on front-line reality, identifying tactical risks in Canton Network implementations early&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years experience in product development or application development management, including hands-on and active business analysis experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years experience in direct people management or formal team leadership experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years experience in Agile ways of working with solid understanding of best-in-class enterprise software development and delivery practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive solution design, business analysis, project management and delivery experience with required leadership presence in meetings gained via working with the largest financial services institutions in Japan, with evidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeable of the emerging fintech and blockchain domain, with attention to smart contract-based initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding client relationship skills with the ability to establish oneself as a trusted, empathetic advisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, including attention to detail, and the ability to design complex processes and workflows from the ground up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to articulate how specific technology designs align to a business case&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to facilitate design sessions with a client and drive the creation of prioritized implementation roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and strong capability in working collaboratively with and granting transparency to internal and external teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management or program management skills, with thorough, meticulous attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and presentation skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable and dynamic problem-solver who relishes challenges in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the financial services or capital markets domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS or MS in Computer Science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Digital Asset, we are committed to compensation structures that reward impact consistently across our global teams. We support our people at every stage of life with comprehensive, family-forward benefits and flexible working models designed to help you do your best work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We offer a comprehensive benefits package designed to support the well-being of our team members. Health and insurance benefits vary by region to ensure local relevance and compliance, and may include medical, dental, and vision coverage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Digital Asset is an equal opportunity employer committed. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, national origin, sex, religion, sexual orientation, age, disability, citizenship status, veteran status, or any other basis protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Eligibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; If and as required by applicable law, all persons hired to work at Digital Asset will be required to verify identity and eligibility to work in the location for which they have an offer to work and to complete the necessary employment eligibility verification documents upon hire.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ccommodations&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Applicants with disabilities who require accommodation during the application or interview process should contact &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:talent@digitalasset.com&quot;&gt;talent@digitalasset.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;California Privacy Act (CCPA)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; If you are based in California, we encourage you to read this important information for California residents linked &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.digitalasset.com/ccpacpranotice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0mfqovz:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who are we?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FalconX is a pioneering team of operators, investors, and builders committed to revolutionizing institutional access to the crypto markets. Operating at the intersection of traditional finance and  cutting-edge technology, FalconX addresses the industry&#39;s foremost challenges: Navigating the digital asset market can be complex and fragmented, with limited products and services that support trading strategies, structures, and liquidity found in conventional financial markets. As a comprehensive solution for all digital asset strategies from start to scale, FalconX operates as the connective tissue empowering clients with seamless navigation through the ever- evolving cryptocurrency landscape.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Counsel, Structured Finance &lt;/strong&gt;to join our legal team as a primary legal advisor to FalconX’s credit businesses. In this high-impact role, you will provide strategic legal guidance on all aspects of digital asset lending, margin, borrowing, and other credit-related activities. You will work cross-functionally with Product, Markets, Risk, Operations, and Compliance teams to support new product development, ensure regulatory compliance, and manage legal risk in a rapidly evolving market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Credit Product Support:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on the structuring, negotiation, and documentation of digital asset loans, margin facilities, borrowing structures, and other credit arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, review, and negotiate master loan agreements, collateral agreements, security documents, and related transactional documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Business Development teams to design and launch new credit products and structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory &amp;amp; Compliance Advisory:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and advise on U.S. and international legal and regulatory frameworks applicable to digital asset lending, including securities, commodities, banking, and consumer protection laws.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor regulatory developments impacting digital asset credit markets and communicate implications to internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Compliance to develop and maintain policies, procedures, and controls for credit operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, assess, and mitigate legal risks associated with credit extension, collateral management, counterparty default, and insolvency scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and implementation of robust risk management frameworks for credit exposures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dispute Resolution &amp;amp; Enforcement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and resolve disputes, litigation, or enforcement actions arising from credit transactions or counterparties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee workout, restructuring, and recovery efforts in distressed situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Markets, Operations, Risk, and Technology teams to ensure seamless execution and settlement of credit transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate business partners on legal and regulatory issues affecting the credit business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;J.D. from an accredited law school; active membership in good standing with at least one U.S. state bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4 - 7 years&lt;/strong&gt; of relevant legal experience, with significant time spent advising on credit, lending, or structured finance matters for financial institutions, fintechs, or digital asset firms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of secured lending, margin, and collateral management practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with UCC Article 9, bankruptcy/insolvency regimes, and digital asset custody considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience drafting and negotiating complex credit and collateral documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the regulatory landscape for digital assets and/or traditional credit products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical, communication, and project management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in fintech, crypto, or digital asset environments preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The base pay for this role is expected to be between $162,000 - $219,000 in the New York City Area. &lt;/strong&gt;This expected base pay range is based on information at the time this post was generated. This role will also be eligible for other forms of compensation such as a performance linked bonus, equity, and a competitive benefits package. Actual compensation for a successful candidate will be determined based on a number of factors such as location, skillset, experience, qualifications &lt;strong&gt;and the level at which the candidate is hired.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notice at Collection and Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants located in California and/or applying to a role based in California, please refer to our Notice at Collection and Privacy Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://docs.google.com/document/d/14H2RKQ1L1ezo605QXotmqxCOnKgIuv21oB-95zR7_0I/edit?usp%3Dsharing&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;source=calendar&amp;amp;ust=1715533493387657&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1Q6amAagRdjSqTfoecQ4aY&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusivity Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FalconX is committed to building a diverse, inclusive, equitable, and safe workspace for all people. Our roles are intended for people from all walks of life. We encourage all those interested in applying to our organization to submit an application regardless if you are missing some of the listed background requirements, skills, or experiences!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our commitment to inclusivity, FalconX would like to acknowledge that the EEOC survey has limited potential responses that you can select. For legal reasons, FalconX must use this language to align with federal requirements, however, we want to ensure that you are able to provide a response to our own voluntary survey questions about your identity that best aligns with your most true self.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;FalconX is an equal opportunity employer and will not discriminate against an applicant or employee based on race, color, religion, national origin, ancestry, ethnicity, sex (including gender, pregnancy, sexual orientation, and gender identity), age, physical or mental disability, veteran or military status, genetic information, citizenship, or any other legally-recognized protected basis under federal, state, or local law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Applicants with disabilities may be entitled to reasonable accommodation under the Americans with Disabilities Act and other applicable state or local laws. A reasonable accommodation is a change in the way things are normally done which will ensure an equal employment opportunity without imposing undue hardship on FalconX. Please inform FalconX’s People team at recruiting@falconx.io, if you need assistance with participating in the application process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0axk9kv:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Social Media Manager to run day-to-day social for two of the most-watched brands in crypto: Ripple and XRP. Few companies have an audience like ours — millions of people who follow every post, quote it, screenshot it, and debate it. That&#39;s a rare asset and a real responsibility. You&#39;ll own the calendar, the copy, and the conversation across X, LinkedIn, YouTube, Instagram and TikTok, translating institutional credibility and community energy into content people actually want to share.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of brand, comms, product marketing and community. You&#39;ll be equally comfortable shipping a same-day reactive post during a market moment and building a multi-week campaign around a major partnership or product launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and execute the social media strategy and editorial calendar across the Ripple and XRP brand channels, including X, LinkedIn, YouTube, Instagram and TikTok.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and produce platform-native content — short-form copy, video, motion graphics, threads and community posts — that makes complex payments, stablecoin, custody and tokenization topics clear and compelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the distinct voices of the Ripple (institutional, enterprise, regulatory-credible) and XRP (community, developer, retail) brands, keeping each authentic while consistent with overall brand guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor conversation in real time and engage the community, exercising sound judgment on when to respond, when to amplify, and when to escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Comms, Legal and Policy on approvals and on reactive moments — regulatory news, market volatility, partnership announcements — where speed and accuracy both matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Brand, Product Marketing, Growth, Events and Developer Relations to turn launches, research, Swell and partner news into coordinated social campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a creative pipeline with in-house designers, video editors and external agencies or creators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify emerging platform features, formats and cultural trends in crypto and fintech, and translate them into proactive content the brands can own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support executive and spokesperson social presence with drafted content and coaching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure and report on performance — reach, engagement, follower growth, share of voice, sentiment and downstream conversion — and use those insights to sharpen what we publish next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle the operational backbone of social: publishing and listening tools, channel governance, account and vendor onboarding, and regular channel audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;WHAT WE&#39;RE LOOKING FOR&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience managing social media for a brand, agency or publisher, with a portfolio of campaigns you can walk us through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent short-form writing and editing skills, with the ability to shift tone between an institutional audience and a crypto-native one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong visual instincts and hands-on experience briefing or producing video and design assets for social.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of growing audience and engagement on X and at least one video-first platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment and composure in a regulated, highly scrutinized environment — you know what not to post.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with social management and listening tools (e.g., Sprinklr, Sprout Social, Brandwatch, Later) and analytics platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to get up to speed quickly on technical and regulatory topics; genuine curiosity about crypto, payments and financial infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding project management and attention to detail, understanding that quality takes precedence over speed or quantity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in real time across global time zones, including occasional evening or weekend coverage for major moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Asana, GSuite, Slack, Content Management Systems (Sanity), AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker who is also comfortable rolling up their sleeves to execute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in crypto, blockchain or financial services strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;For positions that will be based in NY, the annual salary range for this position is below. Actual salaries may vary based on numerous factors including, among other things, an individual applicant’s experience and qualifications for the position. This range does not include equity or additional compensation, such as bonuses or commissions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;NY Annual Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$132,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$165,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do Your Best Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The opportunity to build in a fast-paced start-up environment with experienced industry leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A learning environment where you can dive deep into the latest technologies and make an impact.&amp;nbsp; A professional development budget to support other modes of learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Thrive in an environment where no matter what race, ethnicity, gender, origin, or culture they identify with, every employee is a respected, valued, and empowered part of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In-office collaboration for moments that matter is important to our culture, and we give managers and teams the flexibility to decide which 10+ days a month they come in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bi-weekly all-company meeting - business updates and ask me anything style discussion with our Leadership Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We come together for moments that matter which include team offsites, team bonding activities, happy hours and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Control of Your Finances&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, bonuses, and equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive benefits that cover physical and mental healthcare, retirement, family forming, and family support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee giving match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mobile phone stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Care of Yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;R&amp;amp;R days so you can rest and recharge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous wellness reimbursement and weekly onsite &amp;amp; virtual programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous vacation policy - work with your manager to take time off when you need it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Industry-leading parental leave policies. Family planning benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Catered lunches, fully-stocked kitchens with premium snacks/beverages, and plenty of fun events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Benefits listed above are for full-time employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ripple is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We’re committed to building a diverse and inclusive team. We do not discriminate against qualified employees or applicants because of race, color, religion, gender identity, sex, sexual identity, pregnancy, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, marital status, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, military status, or any other characteristic protected by local law or ordinance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please find our &lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/eu-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;UK/EU Applicant Privacy Notice &lt;/a&gt;and our &lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/ca-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for reference.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1fezz7j:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a 12-week internship during summer 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join the Analytics Engineering team within Platform, which builds and maintains the trusted data infrastructure that powers decision-making across Coinbase. As an Analytics Engineer Intern, you&#39;ll model complex data, build scalable pipelines, and deliver insights that help teams across the company unlock the full potential of our data. You will gain hands-on experience building production data systems at scale, mentorship from senior analytics engineers, and exposure to how data powers decision-making across a publicly traded crypto-native company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dimensional data models that transform raw data into clean, reliable datasets used by analysts, data scientists, and product teams across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop data pipelines using SQL, ensuring data quality, freshness, and documentation meet production standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional stakeholders to understand their data needs and deliver well-structured datasets or dashboards that enable self-serve analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage generative AI tools to streamline data development, modeling, and documentation workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve data quality issues, implementing tests and monitors that catch problems before they reach downstream consumers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing a degree in computer science, data science, statistics, economics, or a related quantitative field, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated proficiency in SQL through coursework, projects, or prior internship experience, with the ability to write complex queries involving joins, window functions, and aggregations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with at least one programming language (Python preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate technical concepts clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences, demonstrated through project presentations, dashboards, documentation, or collaborative work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Req ID: P78159&lt;/p&gt;
