&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker and self-starter with an entrepreneurial spirit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to handle all aspects of the event, from planning to on-site execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a broad-based knowledge of the NYC events market&lt;/li&gt;
