&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QMlddHuGLo2tV0xeZJzlzC8pgEh&quot;&gt;We are seeking a passionate and experienced Product Manager to spearhead the strategy, development, and growth of the OKX DEX Institution Trading Product, primarily focusing on DEX API. This is a critical role that will empower developers, traders, and an ecosystem of third-party applications to leverage the full potential of our industry-leading decentralized exchange aggregator. You will be responsible for defining the product vision, roadmap, and delivering a best-in-class API experience that caters to a diverse range of users, from individual algorithmic traders to large institutional partners and Web3 protocols.&lt;/div&gt;
